KONOHAGAKURE — INUZUKA CLAN NINKEN REGISTRY

The Inuzuka clan fights in partnership with ninken (ninja hounds), raised and bonded from a young age. This registry records the clan's active hound partners.

Registry (sample):
Handler            | Ninken   | Notes
-------------------|----------|-------------------------------
Inuzuka, Kiba      | Akamaru  | Combat partner; Fang Over Fang
Inuzuka, Tsume     | Kuromaru | Clan head's partner
Inuzuka, Hana      | Haimaru triplets | Veterinary corps

Provisions:
- Each ninken is registered and considered a full member of its handler's cell for mission and ration purposes.
- Ninken receive care through the clan's veterinary facilities.
- Handler and hound train and deploy as a single unit; separating a bonded pair on assignment is avoided.

Maintained by the Inuzuka clan head and the Administration Building.
